!% -~S
!% $OMIT_UNUSED_ROUTINES=1
!% $ZCODE_LESS_DICT_DATA=1
!% $LONG_DICT_FLAG_BUG=0
!% $ZCODE_COMPACT_GLOBALS=1
!% $ZCODE_MAX_INLINE_STRING=9999
!
! HISTORY:
!
! OLDER VERSIONS
!
! 961014: First lines of code written.
! 961023: The introduction, the dragon problem and the endgame
!         have been implemented and a first version sent to Staffan Friberg.
! 961028: The first bugs reported by Staffan have been fixed.
! 970728: Added two stones and related problems. Rewrote some texts.
!
! 020204: rewritten in Swedish
! 020304: two new puzzles, some improvments.
! 020305: Ported to Glulx, some graphics added.
!
! 030227: updated to new version of swedish.h. More help texts. Released in public domain.
! 030617: updated to new version of swedish.h.
! 040315: updated to new version of swedish.h. (v1.2, compiler 6.30, library 6/11). Slight cleanup of code.
! 040615: a few bugs fixed and missing description added. New dragon picture in Glulx mode.
!
! CURRENT GAME
!
! 260721: New English translation and a new name, Wyrmward. Ported to PunyInform with many
!         improvements in texts and puzzle design. Both z5 and z6 versions produced, with 
!         the same pictures as the old Glulx version, a few new ones and some sound effects.
! 260816: Release 1 announced
!
! The very first lines of the main source code file for a game can
! contain compiler options, like the lines above. -~S disables
! strict error checking. This is otherwise used in z5 and z8 games by
! default. While useful for debugging, it adds ~10 KB to the story file
! size and it makes the game slower.
! $OMIT_UNUSED_ROUTINES=1 makes the compiler remove all routines which
! aren't used. This can save some space.
! $ZCODE_LESS_DICT_DATA=1 removes an empty data byte for every dictionary word.
! $LONG_DICT_FLAG_BUG=0 enables a bug fix in Inform v6.42+, so plural flags
! on long words are heeded, e.g. 'transmogrifiers//p'.
! $ZCODE_COMPACT_GLOBALS=1 avoids reserving dynmem space for unused globals.

Constant Story            "Wyrmward";
Constant Headline     "^(c) 2026 Johan Berntsson. Type ~help~ for instructions.^";
Release 1; ! restore Ozmoo reference in release 2
Serial "260816";

Array UUID_ARRAY string "UUID://C958551F-A82B-47DD-994B-FFB657010CA4//";
#Ifdef UUID_ARRAY;#Endif;

